#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/CSS/ComputedProperties.cpp (lines 422-888): the SVG fill and stroke
#       readers, flex, order, image-rendering, the background layers (a coordinated value list
#       over the background-* longhands), border-spacing, caption-side, clip, the justify and
#       align properties, the transform readers, accent-color, appearance, the filters and
#       position.
